          "children": [
            {
              "name": "paragraph",
              "props": {
                "text": "A good brief removes noise.",
                "font": {
                  "size": 17,
                  "bold": true,
                  "color": "primary",
                  "lineSpacing": {
                    "type": "multiple",
                    "value": 1.05
                  }
                },
                "spacing": {
                  "before": 0,
                  "after": 4
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "paragraph",
              "props": {
                "text": "It tells the team what must be true, what may remain open, and what should never compete for attention.",
                "font": {
                  "size": 10.5,
                  "color": "#54544E",
                  "lineSpacing": {
                    "type": "multiple",
                    "value": 1.3
                  }
                },
                "spacing": {
                  "before": 0,
                  "after": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "text": "The temptation at the beginning of a project is to collect references. A stronger move is to define the experience in plain language first. When the brief is precise, aesthetic choices become easier because they have a job to do.",
            "spacing": {
              "before": 13,
              "after": 13
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "text": "01  ·  START WITH TENSION",
            "font": {
              "size": 8,
              "bold": true,
              "color": "secondary",
              "characterSpacing": {
                "type": "expanded",
                "value": 20
              }
            },
            "spacing": {
              "before": 6,
              "after": 5
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "text": "Every worthwhile project contains a productive contradiction: warm but disciplined; premium but not precious; dense with information but easy to scan. Naming that tension creates a useful design filter.",
            "spacing": {
              "after": 10
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "text": "02  ·  DEFINE THE AFTERTASTE",
            "font": {
              "size": 8,
              "bold": true,
              "color": "secondary",
              "characterSpacing": {
                "type": "expanded",
                "value": 20
              }
            },
            "spacing": {
              "before": 6,
              "after": 5
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "text": "Ask what someone should remember ten minutes after closing the document or leaving the room. One feeling and one idea are enough.",
            "spacing": {
              "after": 0
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "text": "A SMALL METHOD",
            "pageBreak": true,
            "font": {
              "size": 8,
              "bold": true,
              "color": "secondary",
              "characterSpacing": {
                "type": "expanded",
                "value": 24
              }
            },
            "spacing": {
              "before": 0,
              "after": 16
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "text": "Five lines\nbefore moodboards",
            "themeStyle": "title",
            "font": {
              "size": 27
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "text": "Write these sentences before selecting type, colour, imagery or materials. They make subjective review much easier.",
            "themeStyle": "subtitle",
            "font": {
              "size": 11
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "text": "01\t**Purpose**",
            "font": {
              "size": 11.5,
              "color": "secondary"
            },
            "boldColor": "primary",
            "tabStops": [
              {
                "type": "left",
                "position": 720
              }
            ],
            "spacing": {
              "before": 0,
              "after": 3
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "text": "This exists to help a busy reader understand the decision and feel confident acting on it.",
            "font": {
              "size": 9.5,
              "color": "#434440"
            },
            "indent": {
              "left": 720
            },
            "spacing": {
              "before": 0,
